  <h2 class="heading--box-gitlilac">Who can get an adviser</h2>
  <p>It's never too early to get guidance and support from an adviser. They can help you explore a career in teaching at any stage in your studies, even from your first year at university.</p>

<p>To sign up for an adviser, you must:</p>

<ul>
  <li>have or be studying towards a bachelor’s degree</li>
  <li>not be a qualified teacher</li>
  <li>be interested in becoming a secondary school teacher</li>
</ul>

  <p>If you got your qualifications outside the UK, <a href="tel:08003892500">call us on 0800 389 2500</a> to check if you’re eligible.</p>

  <p>If you’re a veteran, you do not need to have or be studying for a degree to get support from an adviser. <a href="tel:08003892500">Call us on 0800 389 2500</a> to get an adviser.</p>
  </section>
</div>
